2026-11-01T19:36:11.2418843Z               "message": "feat(native): prepare exact runtime donors for common qualification\n\nAdd a separate six-case platform-donor profile and a fixed publish-only Node 14.21.2 target with its verified official source checksum. Reuse the complete existing runtime, ABI, scan and signing gates.\n\nRetain exact Python default selections and fallback narration before costly generated builds. Publish the owned signal-test journal atomically to prevent partial readiness reads.\n\nValidation: complete operator/codegen/vet/envtest, final build-package tests, 84 common qualification controls, 15 publisher controls, matrix controls and the canonical Actions gate passed. Three source quality reviews are clean.\n\nProduction pins and reviewed candidate remain unchanged. Actual new publication, current-source dual-architecture qualification and hosted acceptance remain pending in w1/m188/t009.",
